  specialEffectName: KILLSHOT
  desc_tactics: "Gunslinger pressures his enemies from the backline with high speed
    and high damage from his Deadeye. His Deadeye gets stronger after each use and
    doesn\u2019t Exhaust, but also consumes more AP. Using Quick Draw will help lower
    its cost, or Reload to reset its cost as well as damage. Reload also returns
    all Exhausted action back to his hand. Combo Quick Draw and Reload to let him
    unleash a barrage of Deadeye the next turn. Combo Deadeye with Disabling Shot
    to open the opportunity for devastating damage. He can even Bone Break his enemy
    if he can manage to use Hollow Point before it."
  desc_about: 'Gunslinger Lore Gunslinger Lore Gunslinger Lore Gunslinger Lore Gunslinger
    Lore Gunslinger Lore Gunslinger Lore '
